Package: BicliqueRT
Type: Package
Title: Randomization Tests for Causal Effects under General Interference
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("David", "Puelz", email = "dpuelz@uaustin.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Panos", "Toulis", role = "aut"),
    person("Shuxiao", "Huang", role = "aut"))
Description: Implements biclique-based conditional randomization tests for
    causal effects under general interference. The tests condition on a
    biclique of the null-exposure graph, allowing for complex and arbitrary
    interference patterns between experimental units to be accounted for in
    exact, finite-sample valid tests. Methods are described in Puelz, Basse,
    Feller, and Toulis (2022) <doi:10.1111/rssb.12478>.
